        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "C. Employees shall not be reimbursed for commuting between their home and office or other regular work location. With the approval of the Personnel Administrator an employee's home may be designated as his/her regular office by his/her appointing authority for the purposes of allowed transportation expenses in cases where the employee has no regular office or other work location.",
